## Q4

All employees are expected to _____ the annual meeting.

(A) attend
(B) attend in
(C) participate
(D) comply

**정답: A**

> attend + 행사

---

## Q5

The manager will approve the request if the necessary documents _____.

(A) are attached
(B) attaching
(C) attach
(D) will attach

**정답: A**

### 해설

documents는 첨부되는 대상.

→ 수동태 **are attached**

또한 if절에서는 미래 의미라도 일반적으로 **will을 쓰지 않는다.**

---

